test.yaml:60:37: this step sets "allow-unsafe-pr-checkout", which turns off the protection of actions/checkout that refuses to check out the code of a pull request from a fork in a "pull_request_target" workflow. the step then checks out whatever "ref" and "repository" name, so nothing stops the code of the pull request from reaching a workflow that has a write token and secrets. remove the input and check out the base branch, or document why the code is safe to run [untrusted-checkout]
